messages.text:
I may look like a regular Clerk ⑮, but
in fact I am a glamorous female spy!{be00}
Can you feel it? How strong I am?{be01}

I am investigating the new CEO as part of
my work as a female spy.{be00}
I'll find out what he's hiding!{be01}
But he couldn't really be a child,
could he? That's just ridiculous!
